---
description: TILA FastAPI layering and gateway rules
globs: API/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/backend.md` and `API/AGENTS.md` before editing backend code.

- Flow: `api/v1` → controllers → services → repositories → `core/database`.
- Controllers: no business logic. Services: no FastAPI domain imports.
- Mongo only in repositories. Scope by `userId` for user-owned data.
- LLM only via `app/ai/gateway`. Do not extend `app/ai/llm/*` or `app/factories/llm_factory.py`.
- Raise typed exceptions from `app/core/exceptions.py`; envelope in `docs/errors.md`.
- New settings go through `app/core/config.py` / `.env`, not scattered `os.getenv`.
- Many files are empty scaffolds — follow the gateway as the reference implementation.
